t handoff#Structure#{3}":[103,103],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{4}":[104,104],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{5}":[105,105],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{6}":[106,106],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{7}":[107,107],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{8}":[108,108],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{9}":[109,110],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules":[111,118],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{1}":[113,113],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{2}":[114,114],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{3}":[115,115],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{4}":[116,116],"#April 28th — Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{5}":[117,118]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"session-handoff","date":"2026-04-28","topic":"Built `model-qtr-derive` (single-quarter sheets layer over YTD) and rebuilt `model-calc` from scratch as a quarterly-first forecasting engine. Drivers infer per-row from canonical filing_section + label heuristics (no hand-curated DRIVER_SPECS), then centralize on IS/BS/CF DRIVERS tabs as the single place the user overrides. Source-sheet forecast cells = lookups (value/computed kinds) or rate-applied formulas (ratio kinds). Several sign bugs caught + fixed along the way (Net Change in Cash circular, RE rollforward, dividend payout sign, PP&E rollforward direction, DTA rollforward). PEP_model_v9.xlsx is the locked end-state.","tags":["#session","#model-calc-rebuild","#model-qtr-derive","#quarterly-forecasting","#driver-inference","#centralized-drivers"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Sessions/CELH Model/Handoffs/Archive/April 28th Quarterly Forecasting Layer Session.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"tzn4yf","at":1777392732116},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.06562472,0.00334817,0.04661387,0.02152055,-0.00756868,0.03194816,-0.05881415,0.01350517,0.02428879,-0.00218711,-0.01074505,0.01483134,0.04411953,-0.00379352,0.03677645,0.00267943,-0.01813557,-0.00111253,0.07245271,-0.04072909,0.03870456,-0.04307197,-0.07699833,-0.00499306,0.03471418,-0.00043266,-0.04282347,-0.07971971,-0.06542373,-0.24443838,-0.05553495,0.06183939,-0.05590056,-0.01015972,0.01159193,-0.017425,-0.01395288,0.06395983,0.05200857,0.03292491,0.03767585,0.08532337,-0.04188434,-0.06297665,0.02759604,-0.05750466,-0.02679176,0.03772208,0.00539989,0.00359252,0.02383208,0.01271861,-0.02364349,0.00204426,0.00233529,0.01978442,0.0379031,0.01529532,0.02892561,0.04980027,0.00760567,0.04857601,-0.22299008,0.04825092,-0.02656769,0.02247993,0.02826339,-0.01020726,0.02292722,0.04982885,-0.01031912,-0.02111245,-0.01791068,-0.00912991,0.05064886,-0.08144293,0.00084205,-0.01706099,-0.00386798,-0.00455165,-0.04759214,0.06811263,-0.04828678,0.04744581,-0.01543466,-0.04376165,0.03143074,-0.02768041,0.04570393,-0.00723573,-0.02588872,-0.03086546,0.00480504,0.0319371,-0.04145746,0.00624155,0.04888533,0.00928501,-0.03597215,0.12638541,-0.00773001,0.02939202,0.00666778,0.00085136,0.03543034,-0.02059683,-0.01568609,-0.03294011,-0.01851024,-0.05967486,-0.04394428,-0.00257435,-0.01796398,-0.074595,-0.02877584,-0.02197867,0.06271319,0.03710106,0.07135883,0.00496338,0.0084178,-0.02247902,0.07164715,-0.04476805,0.01321266,0.0127849,0.06266888,0.06694213,-0.00518609,-0.01828541,0.04697877,0.0